sentences.l:
“Trojans and Lycians and Dardanians, close-fighters,
men be, friends, and be mindful of impetuous might
along the hollow ships;

and whoever of you,
hit or struck, death and doom may meet,
let him be dead;

Then Hector took Schedius, Perimedes’ son,
commander of the Phocians, and Ajax took Laodamas,
leader of the foot-soldiers, Antenor’s splendid son;

for no longer is it possible standing apart to fight against the Argives,
before either we kill them, or from the top down
steep Ilios is taken, and the citizens killed.”
